orMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":681,"closed_issues":22796,"state":"open","created_at":"2018-01-18T16:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T09:12:24Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2018-11-08T13:41:59Z","updated_at":"2020-10-11T16:25:00Z","closed_at":"2020-09-10T22:35:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# 🐞 bug report\r\n\r\n### Affected Package\r\nThe issue is caused by package `@angular/common`.\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nI18n methods like `getLocaleDayNames` or `getLocaleMonthNames` (maybe there are more - haven't checked) always returns the same reference.\r\n\r\n\r\nLet the code speak for itself:\r\n```ts\r\nconst dayNames = getLocaleDayNames('en-US', FormStyle.Format, TranslationWidth.Short);\r\n// dayNames = [\"Su\", \"Mo\", \"Tu\", \"We\", \"Th\", \"Fr\", \"Sa\"]\r\n\r\ndayNames.splice(2);\r\n// dayNames = [\"Su\", \"Mo\"];\r\n\r\nconst freshDayNames = getLocaleDayNames('en-US', FormStyle.Format, TranslationWidth.Short);\r\n// freshDayNames = [\"Su\", \"Mo\"]; \r\n// 🙀 🙀 🙀 \r\n```\r\n\r\nThis can lead to undesirable behaviour when some third party library modifies locale data.\r\n\r\n## 🔬 Minimal Reproduction\r\nhttps://stackblitz.com/edit/angular-vbiv7d\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AndrewKushnir","id":43554145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTU0MTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten